==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|govьno|lang=ru}}.

===Noun===
'''говно''' (govnó) {{n}}

#{{uncountable|lang=ru}} {{vulgar|lang=ru}} [[shit]]
# {{vulgar|lang=ru}} [[shit]], [[shitass]], [[turd]] ''(worthless person)''
# {{vulgar|lang=ru}} [[crap]], [[junk]] ''(worthless thing)''
#{{uncountable|lang=ru}} {{vulgar|lang=ru}} [[bullshit]] ''(nonsense)''
#: *{{Cyrl|говно́ [[собачий|соба́чье]]}} — ''dog shit (person or thing)''
#: *{{Cyrl|[[свой|Своё]] говно́ не [[вонять|воня́ет]]}}! — ''One’s own shit doesn’t stink!''
#: *{{Cyrl|Не [[трогать|тро́нь]] говно́, а то воня́ть [[быть|бу́дет]]}}! — ''Shit doesn’t stink until you pester it!''

